1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:01,653
Ini bukan filter.

2
00:00:01,653 --> 00:00:02,854
Siang hari,

3
00:00:02,854 --> 00:00:05,033
langit Kalimantan berubah oranye...

4
00:00:05,033 --> 00:00:06,310
seperti di Mars.

5
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,211
Normalnya,

6
00:00:07,211 --> 00:00:09,915
udara menyebarkan cahaya
biru ke seluruh langit.

7
00:00:09,915 --> 00:00:13,371
Tapi asap kebakaran hutan
menghalangi cahaya biru itu.

8
00:00:13,371 --> 00:00:15,099
Yang lolos tinggal kuning,

9
00:00:15,099 --> 00:00:15,925
oranye,

10
00:00:15,925 --> 00:00:16,986
sampai merah.

11
00:00:16,986 --> 00:00:17,915
Masalahnya,

12
00:00:17,915 --> 00:00:21,183
partikel asapnya 30 kali
lebih kecil dari rambut,

13
00:00:21,183 --> 00:00:22,717
bisa masuk ke paru-paru.

14
00:00:22,717 --> 00:00:24,162
Masker kain tak cukup.

15
00:00:24,162 --> 00:00:25,315
Pakai N95,

16
00:00:25,315 --> 00:00:26,967
dan kurangi keluar rumah.

17
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:28,169
Di kotamu...

18
00:00:28,169 --> 00:00:29,946
langitnya masih biru?
